   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The proboscis monkey (Nasalis larvatus) or long-nosed monkey is a reddish-brown arboreal Old World monkey with an unusually large nose. It is endemic to the southeast Asian island of Borneo.</rdf:li>
